    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "IRAN AIR\nEUROPE\nMIDDLE EAST - FAR EAST\nNORTH AMERICA\n• ..\nSummer Time Table 1975\n29 MAY UNTIL 31 OCTOBER\n(Subject to alteration without notice)\nJATA",
      "IRAN AIR\nTRANSATLANTIC FARES\nFIRST CLASS\n(One Way)\nECONOMY CLASS\n(One Way)\nWINTER:\nNov. thru Mar.\n..\nSHOULDER:\nApr. May Jun. Oct.\n(Westbound)\nApr. May Sept. Oct.\n(Eastbound)\nPEAK:\nJul. Aug. Sept.\n(Westbound)\nJun. Jul. Aug.\n(Eastbound)\n14-21 DAY EXCURSION*\nBASIC:\nBalance of Year ..\nPEAK:\nJul. Aug. Sept. ..\n(Westbound)\nJun. Jul. Aug.\n(Eastbound)\n22-45 DAY EXCURSION*\nWINTER:\nNov. thru Mar.\nSHOULDER: Balance of Year\nPEAK:\nJul. Aug. Sept. .\n(Westbound)\nJun. Jul. Aug.\n(Eastbound)\nUK £232.30\nUK £117.30\nUK £120.80\nUK £120.80\nUK £153.40\nUK £153.40\nUK £204.50\nUK £238.70\nUK £238.70\nUK £145.80\nUK £157.70\nUK £198.20\nUK £198.20\nNOTE: Excursion Fares are based on Round Trip.\nEconomy and First Class fares are double for Round Trip.\n* Weekend Surcharges apply on all Excursion Fares\nUK £5.75 each way\nWeekend: Westbound 0700 Saturday - 0700 Monday\nEastbound 0700 Friday - 0700 Sunday\nFor further information please contact\nyour Travel Agent or Iran Air at\nLondon - Tel: 01-493 8618/9\nNew York - Tel: 212-949-8200\nSubject to alteration without notice\n2001/106 42+L",
      "IRAN AIR\nTRANSATLANTIC\nSERVICES\nFlight No. IR 777\nMON - WED - THU\nFRI - SUN\nAircraft: 707\nClass: F/Y\nLONDON\n(Heathrow)\nDEPART\n1415\nNEW YORK\n(John F. Kennedy)\nARRIVE\n1700\nFlight No. IR 776\nMON - WED - THU\nFRI - SUN\nAircraft: 707\nClass: F/Y\nNEW YORK\n(John F. Kennedy)\nDEPART\n2100\nLONDON\n(Heathrow)\nARRIVE\n(Next day)\n0835\nIRAN AIR TICKET OFFICES:\n73 Piccadilly, London W.1\nTel: 01-491 3656\n17-25 Sloane Street, London S.W.1\nTel: 01-235 8127/8\nReservations Tel: 01-493 8618/9\nLondon Airport Terminal 3 Tel: 01-759 7572\nNew York Tel: 212-949-8200\nSubject to alteration without notice"
